# The optional FFmpeg audio decoder (org.jellyfin.media3:media3-ffmpeg-decoder) lives in the package
# androidx.media3.decoder.ffmpeg, which is inside the R8 package scope. SoftAudio.kt and Media3's
# DefaultRenderersFactory load FfmpegAudioRenderer by reflection, and the native library calls back into
# the decoder classes by name. Keep the whole (small) package unchanged.
-keep class androidx.media3.decoder.ffmpeg.** { *; }

# No renaming/repackaging (12.11.2026): with only some packages in the R8 scope, R8 moved renamed
# subclasses of kotlin.text into another package, which made a package-private superclass inaccessible
# (app crashed at start: IllegalAccessError in androidx.startup.InitializationProvider).
# Optimization (inlining, removing unused code) stays on; only the names stay as they are.
-dontobfuscate
